## Quality Checklist

Before saving a component:
- [ ] Based on code that actually worked in a real app build
- [ ] App-specific logic removed
- [ ] CUSTOMIZE comments added
- [ ] Error handling for common failures
- [ ] destroy()/cleanup method included
- [ ] TypeScript types (not `any` for public API)
- [ ] JSDoc on exports
